le.\n\nWe will have some changes over `usage()` and metrics coming up in the upcoming weeks, but it should not be a blocker for addressing this one already.\n\n> Happy to open a PR if that direction works for you.\n\nThat would be nice, thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/comments/5996665386/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/comments/5998644763","html_url":"https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/pull/3427#issuecomment-5998644763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/3427","id":5998644763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGVTsXc8AAAABZYwOGw","user":{"login":"ChethanaMallisetty21","id":251129631,"node_id":"U_kgDODvfvHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251129631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21","html_url":"https://github.com/ChethanaMallisetty21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChethanaMallisetty21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T16:28:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T16:28:00Z","body":"Hi @diego-plan9,\n\nThank you for the detailed review and suggestions! I've addressed all three comments in commit `1db77b0`:\n\n1. **Clean up `MagicMock`**: Refactored `test_run` in `test/unit/test_session.py` to directly execute `session._run` and assert on `job.backend().name` and `job.session_id`. Removed the unused `from unittest.mock import MagicMock` import.\n2. **Registry state & explicit session registration**: Reverted internal database mutation in `callback_sessions_post` and kept `Session` under `TYPE_CHECKING` in `test/registries/base.py`. Updated `test_context_manager` in both `test/unit/test_session.py` and `test/unit/test_batch.py` to explicitly register the session via `registry.add_session(...)`.\n3. **Docstring update**: Updated `callback_sessions_close` docstring to `\"Close a session (no-op).\"`.\n\nAll 16 unit tests (`test_session.py` and `test_batch.py`) and linters pass cleanly. Ready for another look!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/comments/5998644763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/comments/5998696892","html_url":"https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/pull/3427#issuecomment-5998696892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/issues/3427","id":5998696892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGVTsXc8AAAABZYzZvA","user":{"login":"diego-plan9","id":418311,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODMxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/418311?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diego-plan9","html_url":"https://github.com/diego-plan9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diego-plan9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diego-plan9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api